        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9037P, Ultima III 9037P Knurled Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe textured Knurled Thru-Bolted Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. Choose from the Omnia's modern finish colors. The Round and Knurled Door Pull is stylish--the definitive modern door handle. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Knurled Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9037P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9037P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9037P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-knurled-door-pull-set-omnia-btb-9037p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
